   {"issue": "The defined term \"completed well\" is not the phrase the operative provisions use; Sections 3(D) and 3(B) instead speak of a well \"completed as a well capable of production in paying quantities\". The relationship between the defined term and that operative formula is left unresolved.", "type": 2, "prob": 0.22}
